            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1165-f2" n="2" xml:id="d1165-f2-content">
                <p>Churchill made a statement along these
                    lines at the Eighth Plenary Meeting, July 24. See <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg367">p. 367</ref>.</p>
            </note>
